  "label": "infantilizing appliances",
  "description": "The meme subtly infantilizes the dishwasher by calling it 'at birth,' which is a form of anthropomorphism. This requires background knowledge about how people sometimes anthropomorphize objects (e.g., calling a car 'my baby' or a pet 'my child') and how such language can be used humorously or mockingly. The humor derives from the absurdity of treating an appliance as if it were a newborn human.",
